/* 6位常驻NPC关系推进后的具体日常 6 × 4段 = 24段（塞拉/维斯/诺艾尔/林恩/莫奈/阿什，零初见、必含独立双检定） */
:: MP RelDay Sera 1 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cabin">><<effects>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>>
<<set $mpNpcs to ($mpNpcs or {})>><<set $mpNpcs.sera to ($mpNpcs.sera or { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0 })>><<set _npc to $mpNpcs.sera>>
<<if Weather.precipitation is "rain" and Time.dayState is "night">>雨夜打烊后，塞拉在钟表铺后间<<else>>打烊后的钟表铺后间，塞拉<</if>>煮了一壶热可可。她摘下放大镜揉着酸痛的鼻梁，桌上还摊着一只没校准完的航海怀表。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[先回到塞拉身旁 (0:03)|MP NPC Sera Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpRelDay_mp_relday_sera_1 is 1>>
这处暗格今天已经仔细查验过，眼下并无新的动静。
<<else>>
<div id="relday-sera-1">
<<tendingicon>><<link "替她按揉紧绷的太阳穴 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#relday-sera-1">>
<<if ($tending or 0) gte 230 or ($willpower or 0) gte 400>>
	<<set $daily.mpRelDay_mp_relday_sera_1 to 1>>
	<<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 1)>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 1)>>
	塞拉放松地仰靠在你掌心，轻声说起小时候跟父亲学修表的往事。<span class="green">她在你身边卸下了满身疲惫。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[陪她去周日旧货早市 (0:05)|MP RelDay Sera 2]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<<else>>
	你手劲稍重碰歪了桌角的铜放大镜，塞拉失笑地握住你的手教你认准力道。<span class="red">你有些局促地收回了手。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[擦干手心汗水再试 (0:04)|MP RelDay Sera 1]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[退回安全处 (0:03)|MP NPC Sera Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "镊子帮她调准游丝 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#relday-sera-1">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 240 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpRelDay_mp_relday_sera_1 to 1>>
	<<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 1)>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 1)>>
	你用绒布托稳摆轮，顺着塞拉指点的齿距轻轻拨正游丝。<span class="green">塞拉眉眼弯起，替你把袖口沾上的铜粉拂去。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[陪她去周日旧货早市 (0:05)|MP RelDay Sera 2]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<<else>>
	镊子尖在铜轴边滑了一下，发条轻微回弹。<span class="red">塞拉连忙按住表壳，让你先去柜台旁歇口气。</span><<stress 4>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[看准卡槽位置再试 (0:04)|MP RelDay Sera 1]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[先回入口歇息 (0:03)|MP NPC Sera Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>

:: MP RelDay Sera 2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cabin">><<effects>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>>
<<set $mpNpcs to ($mpNpcs or {})>><<set $mpNpcs.sera to ($mpNpcs.sera or { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0 })>><<set _npc to $mpNpcs.sera>>
<<if Time.dayState is "dawn" or Time.dayState is "morning">>清晨微雾中，<<else>>早市刚开张，<</if>>你陪塞拉去梅尔街旧货早市淘换蓝钢游丝。摊主看她是熟面孔，故意把一只怀表机芯的价格抬高了一倍。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[先回到塞拉身旁 (0:03)|MP NPC Sera Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpRelDay_mp_relday_sera_2 is 1>>
今日的事宜已料理妥当，无需在此处重复费神。
<<else>>
<div id="relday-sera-2">
<<tendingicon>><<link "指出机芯擒纵叉的暗裂 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#relday-sera-2">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 250 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpRelDay_mp_relday_sera_2 to 1>>
	<<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 1)>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 1)>>
	摊主被你一口点破瑕疵，讪讪地按原价把蓝钢游丝让给了你们，塞拉笑着挽住你的手臂。<span class="green">你帮塞拉省下了一笔冤枉钱。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[回钟表铺应付催租管事 (0:05)|MP RelDay Sera 3]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<<else>>
	摊主一口咬定不降价，塞拉拉了拉你的衣袖示意去别家看看。<span class="red">交涉无果，你们在冷风里多跑了两条街。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[放轻手腕力道再试 (0:04)|MP RelDay Sera 2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[收起工具退回 (0:03)|MP NPC Sera Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "替塞拉压低进货价 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#relday-sera-2">>
<<if ($english or 0) gte 250 or ($willpower or 0) gte 420>>
	<<set $daily.mpRelDay_mp_relday_sera_2 to 1>>
	<<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 1)>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 1)>>
	你把年份相近的铜壳怀表归在同一格，连模糊的刻痕也对齐了。<span class="green">塞拉满意地点头，将一盏温热的红茶推到你手边。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[回钟表铺应付催租管事 (0:05)|MP RelDay Sera 3]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<<else>>
	旧木格卡得太紧，你抽拉时震翻了旁边的零件皿。<span class="red">塞拉拾起滚落的铜螺丝，让你先去窗边透透气。</span><<stress 4>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[垫稳脚下重心再试 (0:04)|MP RelDay Sera 2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[转身离开此地 (0:03)|MP NPC Sera Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>

:: MP RelDay Sera 3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cabin">><<effects>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>>
<<set $mpNpcs to ($mpNpcs or {})>><<set $mpNpcs.sera to ($mpNpcs.sera or { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0 })>><<set _npc to $mpNpcs.sera>>
午后刚回钟表铺，商会管事便揣着账本上门，借口修缮外墙想提前收取下季度的铺面押金。塞拉蹙起秀眉站在柜台后。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[先回到塞拉身旁 (0:03)|MP NPC Sera Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpRelDay_mp_relday_sera_3 is 1>>
周围一切平静如常，今天不必再往里翻检了。
<<else>>
<div id="relday-sera-3">
<<tendingicon>><<link "翻出租约指出免责条款 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#relday-sera-3">>
<<if ($english or 0) gte 260 or ($history or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpRelDay_mp_relday_sera_3 to 1>>
	<<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 1)>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 1)>>
	管事见你把市政租约背得分毫不差，灰溜溜地收起账本告辞，塞拉感激地握紧你的手指。<span class="green">你干净利落地替塞拉挡回了刁难。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[随她上阁楼听整点钟声 (0:04)|MP RelDay Sera 4]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<<else>>
	管事嘟囔着改日再来核查，屋里气氛一时有些沉闷。<span class="red">争执让你和塞拉都添了几分烦闷。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[凑近微光看清再试 (0:04)|MP RelDay Sera 3]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[暂退一步歇脚 (0:03)|MP NPC Sera Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "挡在柜台前冷脸送客 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#relday-sera-3">>
<<if ($willpower or 0) gte 450 or ($physique or 10000) gte 11500>>
	<<set $daily.mpRelDay_mp_relday_sera_3 to 1>>
	<<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 1)>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 1)>>
	你顺着屋檐风向稳住提灯，暖黄光晕刚好照亮她手里的卡尺。<span class="green">塞拉靠在你肩侧记下读数，呼吸温热而平稳。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[随她上阁楼听整点钟声 (0:04)|MP RelDay Sera 4]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<<else>>
	夜风灌进灯罩晃花了影子，你脚下一滑差点踩空。<span class="red">塞拉反手扶住你的胳膊，催你先回楼下暖手。</span><<stress 4>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[顺着纹理方向再试 (0:04)|MP RelDay Sera 3]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[顺原路退回 (0:03)|MP NPC Sera Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>

:: MP RelDay Sera 4 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cabin">><<effects>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>>
<<set $mpNpcs to ($mpNpcs or {})>><<set $mpNpcs.sera to ($mpNpcs.sera or { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0 })>><<set _npc to $mpNpcs.sera>>
夜深人静，塞拉牵着你坐上阁楼天窗下的绒毯。
<br><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[先回到塞拉身旁 (0:03)|MP RelDay Sera 5]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<br>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpRelDay_mp_relday_sera_4 is 1>>
你今天已经把这里的首尾收拾干净，先回前头歇息吧。
<<else>>
<div id="relday-sera-4">
<<tendingicon>><<link "揽住她肩膀披上厚绒毯 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#relday-sera-4">>
<<if ($willpower or 0) gte 400 or ($tending or 0) gte 230>>
	<<set $daily.mpRelDay_mp_relday_sera_4 to 1>>
	<<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 1)>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 1)>>
塞拉在你怀里安心闭上双眼，将一枚亲手打磨的黄铜平安扣塞进你掌心。<span class="green">你们在钟鸣里度过了静谧的一夜。</span><<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("relday_sera_4")>><<money 600>><span class="gold">塞拉塞给你 £6 零花补贴。</span><</if>><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<getouticon>><<link [[告别塞拉返回 (0:03)|MP NPC Sera Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>>
	夜风从天窗缝隙漏进来，你打了个寒颤，塞拉连忙起身去关紧木窗。<span class="red">夜凉侵体，你们只得早早下楼歇息。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[活动酸麻手指再试 (0:04)|MP RelDay Sera 4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[先退回原处 (0:03)|MP NPC Sera Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "十指紧扣细数星轨 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#relday-sera-4">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 240 or ($english or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpRelDay_mp_relday_sera_4 to 1>>
	<<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 1)>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 1)>>
你将烘热的羊毛披肩拢在她肩头，又把炉门的通风口调小半格。<span class="green">塞拉顺势握住你的手指，靠在椅背上轻声哼起旧曲。</span><<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("relday_sera_4")>><<money 600>><span class="gold">塞拉塞给你 £6 零花补贴。</span><</if>><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<getouticon>><<link [[告别塞拉返回 (0:03)|MP NPC Sera Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>>
	拨火棍碰落了一块炭灰，火星溅在炉前石板上。<span class="red">塞拉笑着拿湿布扑灭火星，让你先去里间擦手。</span><<stress 4>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[避开湿滑边角再试 (0:04)|MP RelDay Sera 4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[暂且收手离开 (0:03)|MP NPC Sera Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>

:: MP RelDay Vesper 1 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>>
<<set $mpNpcs to ($mpNpcs or {})>><<set $mpNpcs.vesper to ($mpNpcs.vesper or { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0 })>><<set _npc to $mpNpcs.vesper>>
<<if Time.dayState is "dawn" or Time.dayState is "morning">>大雾弥漫的清晨，维斯在防波堤背风处<<else>>海雾未散的防波堤背风处，维斯<</if>>支起铁锅熬鲜鱼汤。他递给你一把短刀，让你帮忙处理刚钓上来的海鲈鱼。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[先回到维斯身旁 (0:03)|MP NPC Vesper Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpRelDay_mp_relday_vesper_1 is 1>>
此处今日已经走过一遭，趁天色尚早去别处转转吧。
<<else>>
<div id="relday-vesper-1">
<<tendingicon>><<link "利落刮鳞片出雪白鱼肉 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#relday-vesper-1">>
<<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 240 or ($tending or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpRelDay_mp_relday_vesper_1 to 1>>
	<<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 1)>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 1)>>
	奶白鱼汤香气四溢，维斯先把最鲜嫩的一碗盛给你，眼神格外柔和。<span class="green">热腾腾的鱼汤驱散了清晨海雾的寒意。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[陪他去干船坞补桐油灰 (0:05)|MP RelDay Vesper 2]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<<else>>
	鱼鳍硬刺扎了一下你的指腹，浓烟也呛得你直揉眼睛。<span class="red">你在处理海鱼时不小心扎痛了手。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[按住底座晃动再试 (0:04)|MP RelDay Vesper 1]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[退回安全处 (0:03)|MP NPC Vesper Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "往炭火里添干柴稳住火候 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#relday-vesper-1">>
<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 240 or ($willpower or 0) gte 420>>
	<<set $daily.mpRelDay_mp_relday_vesper_1 to 1>>
	<<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 1)>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 1)>>
	你按潮位表核对完锚链吃水线，将松动的副缆重新挽成双套结。<span class="green">维斯拍了拍你的手背，把船长室的挡风铜壶递给你。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[陪他去干船坞补桐油灰 (0:05)|MP RelDay Vesper 2]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<<else>>
	咸湿的海风吹迷了眼，麻缆在掌心磨出一道红印。<span class="red">维斯接过缆绳系紧，让你先回底舱避避风浪。</span><<stress 4>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[拂去表面浮尘再试 (0:04)|MP RelDay Vesper 1]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[先回入口歇息 (0:03)|MP NPC Vesper Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>

:: MP RelDay Vesper 2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>>
<<set $mpNpcs to ($mpNpcs or {})>><<set $mpNpcs.vesper to ($mpNpcs.vesper or { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0 })>><<set _npc to $mpNpcs.vesper>>
退潮后的干船坞里，维斯正踩着脚手架给双桅船底舱捻桐油麻丝。木桶里的熟桐油快见底了，船舷高处还有一道缝没封严。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[先回到维斯身旁 (0:03)|MP NPC Vesper Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpRelDay_mp_relday_vesper_2 is 1>>
桌案与器物都已归置妥帖，今天不用再忙活这一摊了。
<<else>>
<div id="relday-vesper-2">
<<tendingicon>><<link "攀上脚手架帮他压实麻丝 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#relday-vesper-2">>
<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 260 or ($physique or 10000) gte 11500>>
	<<set $daily.mpRelDay_mp_relday_vesper_2 to 1>>
	<<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 1)>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 1)>>
	你们配合默契地在涨潮前封严了整条龙骨接缝，维斯跳下木架替你擦去鼻尖沾的油灰。<span class="green">船底接缝被你们修补得滴水不漏。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[替他在暗巷应付眼线 (0:05)|MP RelDay Vesper 3]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<<else>>
	脚手架木板湿滑，你递油桶时洒出半勺桐油沾在靴面上。<span class="red">湿滑木架让你险些扭伤脚踝。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[听准机括声响再试 (0:04)|MP RelDay Vesper 2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[收起工具退回 (0:03)|MP NPC Vesper Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "底熬热桐油递上木勺 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#relday-vesper-2">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 240 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpRelDay_mp_relday_vesper_2 to 1>>
	<<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 1)>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 1)>>
	你借着防风灯的暗光辨出木箱底部的火漆私印，替他分出轻重。<span class="green">维斯眼底闪过赞许，把一枚旧海图铜镇纸塞进你手里。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[替他在暗巷应付眼线 (0:05)|MP RelDay Vesper 3]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<<else>>
	货舱晃动时木箱边角磕在护栏上，发出一声闷响。<span class="red">维斯按灭提灯听了一会儿动静，让你先退去甲板。</span><<stress 4>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[找准借力支点再试 (0:04)|MP RelDay Vesper 2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
