:: MP RelDay Vesper 3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>>
<<set $mpNpcs to ($mpNpcs or {})>><<set $mpNpcs.vesper to ($mpNpcs.vesper or { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0 })>><<set _npc to $mpNpcs.vesper>>
傍晚走出船坞时，一名生面孔的海关眼线在巷口探头探脑，试图打听维斯双桅船今晚的去向。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[先回到维斯身旁 (0:03)|MP NPC Vesper Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpRelDay_mp_relday_vesper_3 is 1>>
暗记与门锁今日已核对无误，留待改日再来留心吧。
<<else>>
<div id="relday-vesper-3">
<<tendingicon>><<link "用港口俚语把眼线支去北岸 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#relday-vesper-3">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 260 or ($english or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpRelDay_mp_relday_vesper_3 to 1>>
	<<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 1)>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 1)>>
	眼线信以为真匆匆往北岸追去，维斯低笑一声，揽着你的肩膀从容转进暗港。<span class="green">你三言两语替维斯引开了眼线。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[随他回船长室烤火夜饮 (0:04)|MP RelDay Vesper 4]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<<else>>
	眼线狐疑地盯着你们看了半晌才走开，维斯只得推迟了今晚的出航计划。<span class="red">眼线起了疑心，你们不得不绕远路离开。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[收敛呼吸节奏再试 (0:04)|MP RelDay Vesper 3]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[暂退一步歇脚 (0:03)|MP NPC Vesper Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "故意撞翻空鱼篓挡住视线 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#relday-vesper-3">>
<<if ($danceskill or 0) gte 250 or ($athletics or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpRelDay_mp_relday_vesper_3 to 1>>
	<<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 1)>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 1)>>
你顺着浪涌的节拍稳住舵轮副柄，船头平稳切开暗礁白浪。<span class="green">维斯从身后环住你的手腕，低声夸你比老水手还稳。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[随他回船长室烤火夜饮 (0:04)|MP RelDay Vesper 4]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<<else>>
	一道横浪拍上船舷，冰凉的海水溅湿了你的半边衣袖。<span class="red">维斯把干毛巾搭在你头上，让你先回船舱烘衣服。</span><<stress 4>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[挽起袖口稳稳再试 (0:04)|MP RelDay Vesper 3]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[顺原路退回 (0:03)|MP NPC Vesper Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>

:: MP RelDay Vesper 4 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>>
<<set $mpNpcs to ($mpNpcs or {})>><<set $mpNpcs.vesper to ($mpNpcs.vesper or { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0 })>><<set _npc to $mpNpcs.vesper>>
夜航归来后，船长室小铁炉上烤着咸鱼干。维斯把厚重的海军呢大衣裹在你身上，坐在你身旁擦拭那枚旧罗盘。
<br><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[先回到维斯身旁 (0:03)|MP RelDay Vesper 5]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<br>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpRelDay_mp_relday_vesper_4 is 1>>
今天这趟差事已经办得利落，先回去喝口热茶缓一缓。
<<else>>
<div id="relday-vesper-4">
<<tendingicon>><<link "靠在他肩头听海浪拍舷 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#relday-vesper-4">>
<<if ($willpower or 0) gte 420 or ($tending or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpRelDay_mp_relday_vesper_4 to 1>>
	<<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 1)>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 1)>>
	维斯反手握住你的手指，把一枚刻着顺风航向的古银币放进你衣袋。<span class="green">船长室的炉火温暖而令人心安。</span><<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("relday_vesper_4")>><<money 600>><span class="gold">维斯塞给你 £6 零花补贴。</span><</if>><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<getouticon>><<link [[告别维斯返回 (0:03)|MP NPC Vesper Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>>
	外海大浪晃动船身，铁炉上的水壶滑落溅出几滴热水。<span class="red">风浪颠簸让你有些头晕倦怠。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[稳住气息重新上手 (0:04)|MP RelDay Vesper 4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[先退回原处 (0:03)|MP NPC Vesper Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "替他用绒布擦亮罗盘表蒙 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#relday-vesper-4">>
<<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 240 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpRelDay_mp_relday_vesper_4 to 1>>
	<<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 1)>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 1)>>
	你用小刀刮净铜壶嘴的盐霜，兑入半勺暖身的陈年朗姆。<span class="green">维斯仰头饮尽热茶，伸手把你揽进带着海风气息的大衣里。</span><<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("relday_vesper_4")>><<money 600>><span class="gold">维斯塞给你 £6 零花补贴。</span><</if>><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<getouticon>><<link [[告别维斯返回 (0:03)|MP NPC Vesper Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>>
	船身颠簸让热汤洒在桌沿，烫红了你的指尖。<span class="red">维斯抓过你的手吹了吹，让你先坐去软榻上歇息。</span><<stress 4>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[换个角度再次尝试 (0:04)|MP RelDay Vesper 4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[暂且收手离开 (0:03)|MP NPC Vesper Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>

:: MP RelDay Noel 1 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<effects>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>>
<<set $mpNpcs to ($mpNpcs or {})>><<set $mpNpcs.noel to ($mpNpcs.noel or { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0 })>><<set _npc to $mpNpcs.noel>>
<<if Time.season is "autumn" or Time.season is "winter">>霜降过后，学园后园的药草垄上结了一层薄霜。<<else>>清晨的露水刚退，学园后园的药草垄上土还湿着。<</if>>诺艾尔抱着一捆稻草帘正犯愁，怕娇嫩的蓝冠草苗冻坏了根。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[先回到诺艾尔身旁 (0:03)|MP NPC Noel Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpRelDay_mp_relday_noel_1 is 1>>
手头的线索今日已经理清，再留在此处也无新发现。
