	<<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 1)>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 1)>>
	二十几株蓝冠草苗被护得严严实实，诺艾尔呵着白气替你拍掉袖口草屑，笑容甜软。<span class="green">药草苗在寒霜里安然无恙。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[陪她去溪谷采秋露甘菊 (0:05)|MP RelDay Noel 2]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<<else>>
	冰冷的晨露打湿了你的袖口与指尖，冻得你连打两个喷嚏。<span class="red">晨霜刺骨，你的手指被冻得发僵。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[擦干手心汗水再试 (0:04)|MP RelDay Noel 1]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[退回安全处 (0:03)|MP NPC Noel Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "木架搭起防 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#relday-noel-1">>
<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 240 or ($physique or 10000) gte 11400>>
	<<set $daily.mpRelDay_mp_relday_noel_1 to 1>>
	<<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 1)>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 1)>>
	你按叶片脉络走向铺平吸水纸，没有折损半片脆弱的银脉花瓣。<span class="green">诺艾尔开心地抿起嘴角，分给你半块沾着桂花蜜的方糖。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[陪她去溪谷采秋露甘菊 (0:05)|MP RelDay Noel 2]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<<else>>
	镊子不小心夹裂了干枯的叶柄，碎屑落在台面上。<span class="red">诺艾尔连忙拿软毛刷拢起碎叶，让你先去窗边歇会儿。</span><<stress 4>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[看准卡槽位置再试 (0:04)|MP RelDay Noel 1]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[先回入口歇息 (0:03)|MP NPC Noel Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>

:: MP RelDay Noel 2 [nobr]
