	<<walkicon>><<link [[放轻手腕力道再试 (0:04)|MP RelDay Noel 2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[收起工具退回 (0:03)|MP NPC Noel Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "在岸边帮她分拣风干花蕾 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#relday-noel-2">>
<<if ($tending or 0) gte 250 or ($science or 0) gte 240>>
