	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[陪他去孤儿院后墙查铁网 (0:05)|MP RelDay Lin 2]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<<else>>
	红薯皮上的黑炭灰烫到了你的指尖，林恩连忙捉住你的手吹了吹。<span class="red">滚烫红薯皮烫红了你的指腹。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[按住底座晃动再试 (0:04)|MP RelDay Lin 1]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[退回安全处 (0:03)|MP NPC Lin Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "用温热药酒替他揉开指节 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#relday-lin-1">>
<<if ($tending or 0) gte 240 or ($science or 0) gte 230>>
	<<set $daily.mpRelDay_mp_relday_lin_1 to 1>>
	<<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 1)>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 1)>>
	你顺着林恩演示的步点沉腰侧身，稳稳卸开了沙袋回荡的冲力。<span class="green">林恩难得露出一抹浅笑，抛给你一瓶冰镇柠檬水。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[陪他去孤儿院后墙查铁网 (0:05)|MP RelDay Lin 2]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<<else>>
	你收势太急扭到了脚踝，后背重重撞在帆布沙袋上。<span class="red">林恩上前一把扶住你的腰，让你先坐到木箱上揉脚。</span><<stress 4>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
