<<else>>
	墨汁被林间夜露洇开，拓片右下角糊成了一团墨团。<span class="red">阿什替你收起宣纸，让你先去篝火边暖一暖冻僵的手。</span><<stress 4>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[找准借力支点再试 (0:04)|MP RelDay Ash 2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[转身离开此地 (0:03)|MP NPC Ash Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>

:: MP RelDay Ash 3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>>
<<set $mpNpcs to ($mpNpcs or {})>><<set $mpNpcs.ash to ($mpNpcs.ash or { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0 })>><<set _npc to $mpNpcs.ash>>
巡山行至北坡荆棘丛时，一阵微弱哀鸣传来——一只梅花幼鹿后蹄被盗猎者留下的旧铁夹卡住，受惊得直往后挣。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[先回到阿什身旁 (0:03)|MP NPC Ash Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpRelDay_mp_relday_ash_3 is 1>>
檐下风声平缓，今天在此处的探查已经足够。
<<else>>
<div id="relday-ash-3">
<<tendingicon>><<link "轻声安抚幼鹿遮住它的眼睛 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#relday-ash-3">>
<<if ($tending or 0) gte 260 or ($seductionskill or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpRelDay_mp_relday_ash_3 to 1>>
	<<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 1)>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 1)>>
	铁夹应声弹开，你们替幼鹿敷上止血草叶放归林间，阿什眼底满是温柔笑意。<span class="green">你们平安救下了受困的林间幼鹿。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[登上树冠瞭望同披斗篷守夜 (0:04)|MP RelDay Ash 4]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<<else>>
	幼鹿挣扎时蹄尖擦过你的小腿，铁夹弹簧也震麻了你的脚背。<span class="red">解救时小腿被擦出一道淤青。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[收敛呼吸节奏再试 (0:04)|MP RelDay Ash 3]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[暂退一步歇脚 (0:03)|MP NPC Ash Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "什合力踩开生锈铁夹簧 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#relday-ash-3">>
<<if ($physique or 10000) gte 11600 or ($athletics or 0) gte 260>>
	<<set $daily.mpRelDay_mp_relday_ash_3 to 1>>
	<<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 1)>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 1)>>
	你抓紧猎犬颈圈上的皮带，顺着风声提前避开了溪谷的落石暗坑。<span class="green">阿什与你并肩站在高岩上，将一枚避风骨哨系在你腕间。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[登上树冠瞭望同披斗篷守夜 (0:04)|MP RelDay Ash 4]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<<else>>
	溪谷乱石硌痛了脚底，猎犬受惊往前猛拽了你一把。<span class="red">阿什吹哨稳住猎犬，扶着你先退回林间平地歇脚。</span><<stress 4>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[挽起袖口稳稳再试 (0:04)|MP RelDay Ash 3]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[顺原路退回 (0:03)|MP NPC Ash Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>

:: MP RelDay Ash 4 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>>
<<set $mpNpcs to ($mpNpcs or {})>><<set $mpNpcs.ash to ($mpNpcs.ash or { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0 })>><<set _npc to $mpNpcs.ash>>
夜幕笼罩林海，繁星在树冠瞭望台上方闪烁。
<br><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[先回到阿什身旁 (0:03)|MP RelDay Ash 5]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<br>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpRelDay_mp_relday_ash_4 is 1>>
你把工具收回贴身衣袋，今天不必再试第二次了。
<<else>>
<div id="relday-ash-4">
<<tendingicon>><<link "依偎在他胸前听林海松涛 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#relday-ash-4">>
<<if ($willpower or 0) gte 420 or ($tending or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpRelDay_mp_relday_ash_4 to 1>>
	<<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 1)>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 1)>>
阿什握紧你微凉的手指，将一枚刻着守林人符文的鹿骨吊坠系在你领口。<span class="green">星光与松涛伴着你们安然守夜。</span><<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("relday_ash_4")>><<money 600>><span class="gold">阿什塞给你 £6 零花补贴。</span><</if>><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<getouticon>><<link [[告别阿什返回 (0:03)|MP NPC Ash Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>>
	半夜山风骤起吹晃了木台，你打了个哈欠，阿什便背着你下楼回石屋歇息。<span class="red">山风微寒让你添了几分困意。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[稳住气息重新上手 (0:04)|MP RelDay Ash 4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[先退回原处 (0:03)|MP NPC Ash Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "借着星光与他辨认北方星宿 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#relday-ash-4">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 250 or ($history or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpRelDay_mp_relday_ash_4 to 1>>
	<<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 1)>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 1)>>
你把晒干的松塔与艾草添进火塘，清苦的草木香很快驱散了寒雾。<span class="green">阿什解开厚重的灰斗篷将你拢进怀里，下巴轻抵着你的额角。</span><<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("relday_ash_4")>><<money 600>><span class="gold">阿什塞给你 £6 零花补贴。</span><</if>><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<getouticon>><<link [[告别阿什返回 (0:03)|MP NPC Ash Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>>
	潮湿的松枝冒出一股浓烟，呛得你连咳了好几声。<span class="red">阿什替你拍着后背顺气，端来温水让你先回石屋歇息。</span><<stress 4>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[换个角度再次尝试 (0:04)|MP RelDay Ash 4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[暂且收手离开 (0:03)|MP NPC Ash Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>
